msgstr "Nambari ya tarakimu 6"

msgid ""
"<strong>%(inviter)s</strong> added you to <strong>%(farm_name)s</strong> on FarmIQ as a\n"
"    <strong>%(role)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(inviter)s</strong> amekuongeza kwenye <strong>%(farm_name)s</strong> kwenye FarmIQ kama\n"
"    <strong>%(role)s</strong>."

msgid "A %(category)s must be female."
msgstr "%(category)s lazima awe wa jike."

msgid "A 6-digit code was sent to %(email)s."
msgstr "Nambari ya tarakimu 6 imetumwa kwa %(email)s."

msgid "A bull must be male."
msgstr "Fahali lazima awe wa dume."

msgid ""
"A calculated blend (not a trained model - there's no data anywhere for \"the ideal mix\") against typical\n"
"            protein values for common Kenyan feed ingredients. Review and edit it below before saving."
msgstr ""
"Mchanganyiko uliokokotolewa (si mfumo uliofunzwa - hakuna data ya \"mchanganyiko bora\") ukilinganisha na\n"
"            viwango vya kawaida vya protini kwa viungo vya chakula vya kawaida nchini Kenya. Kagua na uhariri hapa chini kabla ya kuhifadhi."

msgid "A cow with this tag ID already exists on this farm."
msgstr "Ng'ombe mwenye kitambulisho hiki tayari yupo kwenye shamba hili."

msgid ""
"A detailed, comprehensive report - milk, feeding, herd, crops, inventory and"
" finance - for a day, month, quarter or year."
msgstr ""
"Ripoti ya kina - maziwa, chakula, mifugo, mazao, bidhaa na fedha - kwa siku,"
" mwezi, robo mwaka au mwaka."

msgid ""
"A full dashboard plus one-click exports to CSV, Excel or PDF - or have a "
"report emailed to you instantly, weather included."
msgstr ""
"Dashibodi kamili pamoja na kuhamisha data kwa CSV, Excel au PDF kwa kubofya "
"mara moja - au pata ripoti kupitia barua pepe papo hapo, ikiwa na hali ya "
"anga."

msgid ""
"A hot spell is ahead. Check water troughs more often and make sure the herd "
"has shade in the middle of the day."
msgstr ""
"Kipindi cha joto kinakuja. Angalia mabirika ya maji mara kwa mara na "
"hakikisha mifugo ina kivuli mchana."

