msgid ""
"Correlation coefficient: <span class=\"font-extrabold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">%(coefficient)s</span>\n"
"        (based on %(days)s days with both feed and milk logged). Closer to 1 means more feed tracks\n"
"        closely with more milk; closer to 0 means little relationship in this period."
msgstr ""
"Mgawo wa uhusiano: <span class=\"font-extrabold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">%(coefficient)s</span>\n"
"        (kutokana na siku %(days)s zenye rekodi za chakula na maziwa). Karibu na 1 inamaanisha chakula kingi\n"
"        kinaendana na maziwa mengi; karibu na 0 inamaanisha uhusiano mdogo katika kipindi hiki."

