msgid "Weather & field advisory"
msgstr "Hali ya anga na ushauri wa shambani"

msgid ""
"Live 5-day forecasts for your exact farm location, plus plain-language "
"advisories - know when to hold off spraying or add extra water before a "
"hot, dry spell."
msgstr ""
"Utabiri wa moja kwa moja wa siku 5 kwa eneo hasa la shamba lako, pamoja na "
"ushauri kwa lugha rahisi - jua wakati wa kusitisha kunyunyizia dawa au "
"kuongeza maji kabla ya kipindi cha joto na ukame."

msgid "Light & dark mode"
msgstr "Hali ya mwanga na giza"

msgid ""
"Switch between a bright or dark theme any time - it’s saved to your "
"account and remembered on every device."
msgstr ""
"Badilisha kati ya mandhari angavu au ya giza wakati wowote - inahifadhiwa "
"kwenye akaunti yako na kukumbukwa kwenye kila kifaa."

msgid "English & Kiswahili"
msgstr "Kiingereza na Kiswahili"

msgid ""
"Use FarmIQ in English or Kiswahili - switch any time from the header, and "
"it’s remembered for next time."
msgstr ""
"Tumia FarmIQ kwa Kiingereza au Kiswahili - badilisha wakati wowote kutoka "
"sehemu ya juu, na itakumbukwa wakati mwingine."

msgid "Light and dark mode"
