msgstr "Vituo vya utafiti na ugani vya KALRO karibu na shamba hili"

msgid ""
"General guidance only - for a sick animal or a spreading crop problem, "
"contact a licensed veterinarian, your county agricultural officer, or the "
"nearest KALRO center for a proper diagnosis."
msgstr ""
"Mwongozo wa jumla tu - kwa mnyama mgonjwa au tatizo la mazao linaloenea, "
"wasiliana na daktari wa mifugo aliyesajiliwa, afisa wa kilimo wa kaunti "
"yako, au kituo cha KALRO kilicho karibu kwa uchunguzi sahihi."

